  m_Name: Carta_RuasCompletas
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Ruas Completas
  _titleEn: Complete Streets
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Ruas completas s\xE3o desenhadas para todos: cal\xE7adas largas, travessias
    seguras, ciclovias e faixas de \xF4nibus, n\xE3o s\xF3 para carros."
  _summaryEn: 'Complete streets are designed for everyone: wide sidewalks, safe crossings,
    bike lanes and bus lanes, not only cars.'
  _realWorld: "A pol\xEDtica de Complete Streets foi adotada por centenas de cidades
    nos Estados Unidos; no Brasil, o WRI Brasil apoia projetos de ruas completas
    em v\xE1rias capitais."
  _realWorldEn: Complete Streets policies have been adopted by hundreds of US cities;
    in Brazil, WRI Brasil supports complete streets projects in several state capitals.
  _tradeOffs: "Tirar faixas ou vagas de carro gera resist\xEAncia de motoristas e
    comerciantes, e a obra atrapalha a rua por meses."
  _tradeOffsEn: Removing car lanes or parking draws resistance from drivers and shop
    owners, and the works disrupt the street for months.
  _sources:
  - Label: Complete streets (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Complete_streets
  - Label: WRI Brasil, Ruas Completas
    Url: https://www.wribrasil.org.br/ruas-completas
